    {
      "id": "legend",
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Legend says the inventor of chess showed his game to a king. Delighted, the king offered any reward. The inventor asked for something that sounded modest:\n\n> *\"Place one grain of rice on the first square of the board, two on the second, four on the third, and keep doubling until all 64 squares are filled.\"*\n\nThe king laughed at such a small request. He shouldn't have."
    },
    {
      "id": "board",
      "type": "image",
