    {
      "id": "s-total",
      "type": "section",
      "title": "2. Adding it all up",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "total-text",
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "Here's a beautiful shortcut. The total on the first $n$ squares is always **one less than the next square**:\n\n$$\n1 + 2 + 4 + \\dots + 2^{\\,n-1} = 2^{\\,n} - 1\n$$\n\nSo the whole board holds\n\n$$\n2^{64} - 1 = 18{,}446{,}744{,}073{,}709{,}551{,}615 \\text{ grains.}\n$$"
        },
        {
          "id": "total-graph",
          "type": "graph",
          "title": "Running total after each square",
          "kind": "line",
          "xLabel": "Square",
          "yLabel": "Total grains",
          "data": [
            {
              "x": 1,
              "y": 1
            },
            {
              "x": 2,
              "y": 3
            },
            {
              "x": 3,
              "y": 7
            },
            {
              "x": 4,
              "y": 15
            },
            {
              "x": 5,
              "y": 31
            },
            {
              "x": 6,
              "y": 63
            },
            {
              "x": 7,
